Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:28.60,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 多伦多 WTA1000 第三轮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:28.60,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}伊埃拉 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}6-3 5-7 6-4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 麦克纳莉 · 赛后新闻发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.70,0:00:03.26,EN,,0,0,0,,Alex, congratulations on an incredible win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.70,0:00:03.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 恭喜这场精彩的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:05.74,EN,,0,0,0,,After the match, you kind of just sat there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.26,0:00:05.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,赛后你坐在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:07.18,EN,,0,0,0,,and just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:07.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,就那样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.18,0:00:08.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Can you explain that moment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.18,0:00:08.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,能说说那一刻吗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:10.54,EN,,0,0,0,,and just what was going through your mind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.70,0:00:10.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,你当时在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.54,0:00:11.42,EN,,0,0,0,,and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.54,0:00:11.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:12.38,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.42,0:00:12.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:14.62,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Um I think this match
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:14.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:17.34,EN,,0,0,0,,was was really challenging for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:17.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说真的很有挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:20.06,EN,,0,0,0,,I think the whole two weeks I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:20.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,这整整两周
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:22.30,EN,,0,0,0,,have been very challenging
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:22.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,都很有挑战
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:24.94,EN,,0,0,0,,and each match that I've played
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:24.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,我打的每一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:29.02,EN,,0,0,0,,has presented its unique set of challenges.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:29.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,都有各自不同的难题
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:33.90,EN,,0,0,0,,Um yeah, today obviously was really close
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.02,0:00:33.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天这场确实很胶着
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:37.18,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think you know like I'm I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.90,0:00:37.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:40.38,EN,,0,0,0,,really of course I'm feeling the effects
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.18,0:00:40.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实感觉到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.38,0:00:42.06,EN,,0,0,0,,of you know just everything
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.38,0:00:42.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,这一切带来的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:43.66,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think I'm really doing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:43.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的在尽力
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:44.94,EN,,0,0,0,,my best like I said on court
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.66,0:00:44.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像我在场上说的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:49.34,EN,,0,0,0,,to um you know to stay professional
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.94,0:00:49.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,保持专业
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:51.50,EN,,0,0,0,,and stick to what I know but everything
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.34,0:00:51.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,做我熟悉的事 但这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:53.34,EN,,0,0,0,,of course like this past two weeks I've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:53.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,这两周我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:56.38,EN,,0,0,0,,been feeling emotions so extremely
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.34,0:00:56.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,情绪一直很强烈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.38,0:00:58.46,EN,,0,0,0,,because of the the circumstances
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.38,0:00:58.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为这些经历
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.46,0:01:00.30,EN,,0,0,0,,which is which is a great thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.46,0:01:00.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,这其实是件好事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:02.54,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, I love I'm I think I'm quite a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.30,0:01:02.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我是个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.54,0:01:03.98,EN,,0,0,0,,sentimental person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.54,0:01:03.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,挺重感情的人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:05.10,EN,,0,0,0,,Um but at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:05.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,但同时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:07.26,EN,,0,0,0,,it's just kind of like finding that balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.10,0:01:07.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,也在找一个平衡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:09.42,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I think um I'm really proud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.26,0:01:09.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我挺为自己骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:10.62,EN,,0,0,0,,of how I handled today
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.42,0:01:10.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天处理得不错
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.62,0:01:13.58,EN,,0,0,0,,and and and what I did on court.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.62,0:01:13.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,场上的表现也是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.58,0:01:15.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Alex, there there were so many times
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.58,0:01:15.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,亚历克斯 这场好多次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.18,0:01:16.78,EN,,0,0,0,,during the match where you were tested,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.18,0:01:16.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,你都被逼到了极限
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.78,0:01:18.06,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, you had to come up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.78,0:01:18.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,你不得不
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.06,0:01:19.82,EN,,0,0,0,,from early holes in the games.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.06,0:01:19.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,从落后的局面里爬出来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.82,0:01:20.46,EN,,0,0,0,,What are you kind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.82,0:01:20.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:22.22,EN,,0,0,0,,of telling yourself in the moment uh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:22.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种时候心里在想什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:23.10,EN,,0,0,0,,when you're fighting back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:23.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,当你从落后的比分里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:25.18,EN,,0,0,0,,from those early deficits and games?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.10,0:01:25.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,往回拼的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:28.70,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think I need I try
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:28.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.70,0:01:30.78,EN,,0,0,0,,to focus more on factual things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.70,0:01:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,更专注在事实上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.78,0:01:33.74,EN,,0,0,0,,So, um I mean of course there
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.78,0:01:33.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:34.94,EN,,0,0,0,,are many external factors
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.74,0:01:34.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,有很多外部因素
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.94,0:01:37.42,EN,,0,0,0,,but there are things that also I can control
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.94,0:01:37.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,但也有我能控制的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.42,0:01:39.42,EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm I was aware of the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.42,0:01:39.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很清楚当时的局面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.42,0:01:41.26,EN,,0,0,0,,I know that she was playing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.42,0:01:41.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道她打得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:42.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Um I know that I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:42.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,我也知道我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:44.62,EN,,0,0,0,,was missing certain balls here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.22,0:01:44.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,有些球没处理好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:47.90,EN,,0,0,0,,So I tried to just play the point better
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:47.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我就想把这一分打
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:48.94,EN,,0,0,0,,than the point before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.90,0:01:48.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,得比上一分更好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.94,0:01:50.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.94,0:01:50.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.22,0:01:51.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Hi Alex, well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.22,0:01:51.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,你好 亚历克斯 打得漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.18,0:01:53.50,EN,,0,0,0,,So, the the Blue Dinosaur super fan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.18,0:01:53.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,那个蓝色恐龙的超级粉丝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:54.62,EN,,0,0,0,,was back today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.50,0:01:54.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:55.98,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:55.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,天呐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.98,0:01:57.90,EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god. How just talk
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.98,0:01:57.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,天呐 说说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.90,0:01:58.86,EN,,0,0,0,,about your new super fan
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.90,0:01:58.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,你这位新粉丝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.86,0:02:00.38,EN,,0,0,0,,and how much are you noticing him,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.86,0:02:00.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,你注意到他了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.38,0:02:01.58,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, throughout the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.38,0:02:01.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,整场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.58,0:02:03.50,EN,,0,0,0,,You know, today I didn't see him
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.58,0:02:03.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实今天我没看见他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:04.22,EN,,0,0,0,,in the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.50,0:02:04.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,在人群里
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:05.98,EN,,0,0,0,,I knew he I know he was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.22,0:02:05.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我知道他在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:07.58,EN,,0,0,0,,People told me he was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.98,0:02:07.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,有人跟我说他来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:09.74,EN,,0,0,0,,Um but wow, what a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:09.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,他真的很传奇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.74,0:02:11.02,EN,,0,0,0,,Like it was so funny
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.74,0:02:11.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,第一晚我第一次看见他的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:13.82,EN,,0,0,0,,when I first saw him the first night.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.02,0:02:13.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的太好笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:15.18,EN,,0,0,0,,Amazing. And I think it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:15.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,真是 我是说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.18,0:02:16.46,EN,,0,0,0,,was just I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.18,0:02:16.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,说不上来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:19.42,EN,,0,0,0,,It just it was like such a light funny spin
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.46,0:02:19.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是给大家支持我的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:23.18,EN,,0,0,0,,to kind of like how how people support me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.42,0:02:23.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,添了一种轻松好玩的调调
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:25.74,EN,,0,0,0,,It just comes out in very unique ways
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.18,0:02:25.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,每个人支持的方式都很不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:28.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and I think he's really stood out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:28.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,他这个真的很突出
